ing Plants of Nepal' >Annotated Checklist of the Flowering Plants of Nepal</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=60&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Chile' >Flora of Chile</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of China' >Flora of China</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=11&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Missouri' >Flora of Missouri</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=1&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of North America' >Flora of North America</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=101&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Taiwan Checklist' >Flora of Taiwan Checklist</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=201&taxon_id=130307'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Trees and shrubs of the Andes of Ecuador' >Trees and shrubs of the Andes of Ecuador</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Sida'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Sida&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Sida'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\"></TD>\r\n\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </TD>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td>\r\n<table id=\"SubHeaderTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#99cc99\" id=\"SubHeaderTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <TD align=\"center\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHome\" href=\"index.aspx\" target=\"_top\">eFlora Home</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkPeopleSearch\" href=\"person_search.aspx\" target=\"_top\">People Search</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHelp\" href=\"help_page.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Help</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkActKey\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/ActKey\" target=\"_top\">ActKey</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink2\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/HuCards/\" target=\"_top\">Hu Cards</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink1\" href=\"glossary.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Glossary</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n          </TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </TABLE>\r\n  <a href=\"/url.html\" style='display:none'>login</a></body>\r\n</HTML>\r\n"
